🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps being killed by its liveness probe, likely because its containers are not ready when liveness gives up. Liveness gives api 30s (0s delay + 3 × 10s), and api was not ready when each kill came. Its last run lasted 40 seconds; three restarts since its pod was created one hour ago. Fix in: deployment/api → container app → livenessProbe (initialDelaySeconds 0, periodSeconds 10, failureThreshold 3). To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs api-ee79f8f9-a -c app -n shop --previous
